{
  "schema": "fablereborn.raid-node",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Siege of Stormhold: War Council",
  "description": "Siege defence where the party allocates supplies by vote. Before each of 3 assaults, a War Council runs and every hero's vote is applied: +2 Soldiers, +2 Archers, +15 Gate, +1 Medic or +4 Supplies each. The garrison fights on its own: Soldiers hit a random enemy (10 each), Archers volley all enemies (3 each), Medics heal all (3 each). Enemies batter the Gate (4 each per round) and Siege Rams add 12. The Warlord's catapult kills Soldiers. Roles: Captain (1) spends Supplies to Rally soldiers or sound the War Horn; Engineers (2) repair the Gate or fire the Ballista; Defenders brace the Gate. At Gate 0 the walls are breached; a second breach, or any in the final assault, leads to Failure. Next: dawn (bonus if Gate is 80+). Failure: Stormhold falls.",
  "entry": "siege_intro",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "siege_intro",
      "kind": "scene",
      "title": "The Siege of Stormhold",
      "text": "Torches stretch to the horizon. The Warlord's army has come for **Stormhold**, and you are all that stands between them and the keep.\n\nBefore each assault you hold a **War Council**. **Each hero allocates their own wagon of supplies**: soldiers, archers, masons, medics or stockpiled supplies. Build the defence together.\n\n**Roles:** 🎖️ one **Captain** (rallies soldiers, sounds the War Horn), up to two **Engineers** (repair the Gate, fire the Ballista), and everyone else is a **Defender** holding the wall.\n\nIf the **Gate** falls to 0, the walls are breached. Two breaches, or any breach in the final assault, and Stormhold falls.",
      "next": "council_1",
      "rules": []
    },
    {
      "id": "council_1",
      "kind": "choice",
      "title": "War Council: Dusk",
